id: pm-gh1552
title: "GH-1552: charge SDK read budgets using compact JSON envelopes"
description: "SDK execute path forces resolvedOutputFormat=json and measures pretty CLI output, contradicting the compact JSON SDK contract. Make structured SDK estimates, packing and session debits match complete compact UTF-8 envelopes while keeping actual CLI JSON and TOON rendering exact."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[3]: context-management,"gh:1552",sdk
created_at: "2026-10-23T06:27:42.713Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-23T07:19:25.288Z"
assignee: "harness:codex"
claim_principal: "harness:codex#6f99bebef8f9d7d8189fed31"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 150
acceptance_criteria: No-format SDK session estimates equal ceil UTF-8 compact serialized envelope bytes/4; Budget packing uses the same SDK serializer including infeasible envelopes; Explicit rendered host formats remain exact; Existing read/session/type and packed consumer regressions pass.
parent: pm-5t33or
risk: medium
confidence: high
expected_result: Unformatted SDK packing and session debits match complete compact UTF-8 envelopes; explicitly selected JSON/TOON and actual CLI bytes retain their own exact estimates.
