comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-23T06:27:42.713Z","harness:codex","Intake: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1552. Duplicate checks used live request-specific search, open/in_progress lists, and complete all-status strict read of 3067 items (2789 closed, 14 canceled); related delivered lineage remains closed. No matching active item exists. Selected with the companion SDK read-envelope issue for one reviewed PR."
  "2026-10-23T06:29:23.224Z","harness:codex","Investigation: dispatchAction unconditionally sets resolvedOutputFormat=json before attaching read contracts. The estimator already supports compact JSON when no renderer is supplied; remove the forced host-renderer choice at the structured SDK boundary, retain explicit outputFormat JSON/TOON and conservative default ceilings. Existing docs explicitly distinguish unformatted SDK objects from rendered CLI output."
  "2026-10-23T06:33:49.583Z","harness:codex","Pre-fix runtime regression: the real temporary-tracker SDK consumer charged 631 tokens while ceil(UTF-8 compact complete envelope/4) was 462. The same test now passes for no format, explicit JSON and explicit TOON, with session debits and infeasible no-session omission envelopes. The first broad focused run passed 67 cases and exposed a host npm resolution configuration issue in packed acceptance; rerunning that maintained harness with NODE_PATH set to the actual installed npm module root. No product workaround was added."
  "2026-10-23T06:46:52.074Z","harness:codex","Independent operational evidence October23: strict registry+OSV advisory gate passes568 locked versions; GitHub Dependabot, CodeQL and secret-scanning open inventories are empty. Sentry14-day critical/high gate is0/0 with zero unresolved issues; streamed pm.command spans for fresh get/list probes are present (pm get137.32ms, pm list85.16ms), even though legacy transaction trace listing is empty. The telemetry database has recent1:1 command_start/command_finish pairs per session for get/list; physical local event queue and broker queue are empty, and all six Prometheus targets are up. Seven-day telemetry error rate4.54percent has zero missing error-code rows. These are separate current delivery checks, not claims about historical release reliability."
  "2026-10-23T07:07:46.925Z","harness:codex","All original full-suite timing cases passed in the sequential retry; explicit JSON selector parity now passes with matching canonical encoding provenance on CLI and SDK. Linked accounting/transport tests recorded passed in10.22s. Static quality requested a lower-complexity test callback, so encoding cases are now parameterized without changing assertions, production code, deadlines or thresholds; rerun linked/static gates after that test-only refinement."
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-23T07:01:17.983Z","harness:codex","Full-suite review identified one expected transport-accounting assertion change: sdk-context-integrity compares the entire CLI JSON envelope to an SDK call with no selected renderer. Set outputFormat=json on that comparison so it still proves exact rendered parity; the new compact SDK accounting controls remain independent. The initial queued static and linked runs exceeded the exclusive build-lease wait, rather than producing quality verdicts; preserve those attempts and rerun sequentially."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-23T06:38:37.774Z","harness:codex","Serialization used to enforce context budgets is part of the SDK contract. Keep structured SDK measurement independent from CLI rendering, and verify the complete envelope including read/session receipts and next state from the packed consumer."
